WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.740
From the Host List, tap the plus button to add a host.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:25.180
In Quick connect, enter your username, server address, and optionally port. For example: demo, at, example dot com. Remember, this is only an example host, so you must replace these example details with your own. Port twenty-two is the usual SSH port.

3
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.360
Tap Add host to save the connection.

4
00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:35.593
The saved host appears in the Host List. Simply tap it when you are ready to connect.
